{"title": "Lightning Aura", "pageid": 23669, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Lightning_Aura", "categories": ["Class actions", "Dexterity saving throws", "Actions", "Sources of Lightning damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Lightning_Aura.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Lightning_Aura.webp/300px-Lightning_Aura.webp, /w/images/5/50/Lightning_Aura.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Lightning_Aura.webp/300px-Lightning_Aura.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Lightning_Aura.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Lightning Aura</b> is a special class action granted by <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Real_Sparky_Sparkswall\" title=\"The Real Sparky Sparkswall\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/The_Real_Sparky_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-The_Real_Sparky_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/The_Real_Sparky_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Real_Sparky_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/The_Real_Sparky_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-The_Real_Sparky_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/The_Real_Sparky_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-The_Real_Sparky_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/The_Real_Sparky_Sparkswall_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Real_Sparky_Sparkswall\" title=\"The Real Sparky Sparkswall\">The Real Sparky Sparkswall</a> that allows the wielder to activate a lightning aura that deals damage to enemies on their turn and prevents reactions.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nConsume 3 <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Charges (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning Charges\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Lightning_Charges_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Charges_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Charges (Condition)\">Lightning Charges</a> and release a blast of electricity that damages and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jolted_(Condition)\" title=\"Jolted (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Jolted_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Jolted_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Jolted_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Jolted_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Jolted_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Jolted_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jolts\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Jolted_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Jolted_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c5/Jolted_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jolted_(Condition)\" title=\"Jolted (Condition)\">Jolts</a> nearby enemies.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd><dt>Damage: 2~10</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:42px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:9px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:1;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/D6_Lightning.png/27px-D6_Lightning.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/D6_Lightning.png/40px-D6_Lightning.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/D6_Lightning.png/54px-D6_Lightning.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/D6_Lightning.png/27px-D6_Lightning.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-elemen